<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>LOOTOPIA - Welcome</title>
  {{ style('style') }}
</head>
<body>
  <nav>
    <div class="nav-left">
      <ul class="nav-list">
        <li class="pointer" onclick="location.href = '/player'">Joueur</li>
            <li class="pointer" onclick="location.href = '/organisator'">Organisateur</li>
            <li class="pointer" onclick="location.href = '/recompenses'">Récompenses disponibles</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-right" id="user-info">
  </div>
  </nav>
  <div class="scroll_y_auto">
    <img src="/lootopia.webp" width="170" height="170" alt="LOOTOPIA" /><br />
    This platform is dedicated to the participation and organization of treasure hunts. It will be based on the use of virtual and semi-virtual caches, enhanced by Augmented Reality (AR) technologies accessible via smartphones and tablets.<br/>
    The treasure hunt will be designed as a multifunctional tool: a fun medium for participants, but also a powerful communication and marketing vehicle for organizers wishing to promote their initiatives or brand.<br />
    <button class="bigbutton">Game modes</button><br />
    <button class="bigbutton">Available flushes</button> <br />
    @if(!username)
      <button class="bigbutton" onclick="location.href = '/login'">Log in</button>
    @endif
</div>
  <footer>
    <div class="nav-right">
      <ul class="nav-list">
        <li>© 2025 Ashley RAKOTOARISOA<br />Projet réalisé dans le cadre de Sup de Vinci</li>
      </ul>
  </div>
</footer>
<script type="module">
  import Cookie from 'https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/js-cookie@3.0.1/dist/js.cookie.mjs'
      const username = Cookie.get('username')
      let userInfo = document.getElementById('user-info')

    if(username){
        userInfo.innerHTML = "<img src='/account.webp' class='pointer' alt='Profil' width='30' height='30' /><span>"+username+"</span><button onclick='deconnecter()' class='buttond'>Déconnexion</button>"
      } else {
        userInfo.innerHTML = "<img src='/account.webp' class='pointer' onclick='location.href = "+'"/login"'+"' alt='Profil' width='30' height='30'/><span>Se connecter</span>"
      }

       window.deconnecter = function() {
        var con = confirm("Are you sure ?")
        if (con){
          Cookie.remove("username")
          location.reload()
        }
      }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
